      <div class="ve-wrap vh-trail__after">
        <p class="ve-lede" data-reveal="up">The bungalow sits between the end of Stage 1 at Galaha Post Office and the start of Stage 2, five minutes from your boots to the trail. Stage 3 begins twenty minutes away by car.</p>
        <ul class="vh-trail__hooks" data-reveal="up" data-delay=".1">
          <li>We move your bags. You enjoy the trail.</li>
          <li>Pickup from Kandy or Peradeniya Station</li>
          <li>Breakfast from 6:30 AM, packed lunches the night before</li>
          <li>Leech socks, trail briefings and weather updates</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="vh-trail__cta" data-reveal="up" data-delay=".2">
          <a class="ve-btn ve-btn--gold" href="/packages" data-magnetic><span>Hiker packages</span></a>
          <a class="ve-link" href="/pekoe-trail">Full trail guide <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
