          <h2 class="ve-h2" data-split>Find us<br><em>in the hills.</em></h2>
          <p class="ve-lede" data-reveal="up">Galaha Estate sits in Sri Lanka&rsquo;s central highlands, about 45 minutes from Kandy. Private transfers from the airport, Kandy city, Kandy Railway Station and Peradeniya Station.</p>
          <ul class="vh-where__list" data-reveal="up" data-delay=".1">
